      50166 accounted for             A RACE, and a narrow one: auth.uspListMyProfiles read the session through auth.uspSetSessionContext one statement earlier and cannot read the row back. Reaching it means ending that session from another connection inside that window, which no test can time reliably, and which is exactly the situation the number exists to describe. T-126 added it so a caller in that race is told "sign in again" rather than handed an empty list, which reads as "you have no profiles".                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   
